  (descr "Atari ST/STE/Mega 40-pin card-edge cartridge connector. Geometry verified against a real Eagle 9.6.2 project (library con-amp_atari_st, package ATARI_ST_CART), itself sourced from a TE Connectivity/Tyco 0.05 Series Standard Edge connector datasheet (ENG_CD_145167_F.pdf). Board outline / Edge.Cuts must still be drawn by hand to match your enclosure.")
